  step,dige:1fcc5bcdd71c806a
  step=2,desc:a code search lands — the Door hits across twelve files fetched from the sample in the Searchbar hit shape,dige:254f9557d6288f57
  step=3,desc:stand the search as a spine — every file a vertebra behind the head and every crowded file folded to a few ribs by kind,dige:a870aca422c1b562
  step=4,desc:re-search Door to Heist in the same world — the creature re-forms around twenty-one files and the head morphs,dige:9811e99f9cbbb24e
  step=5,desc:press the Def crest of Heist.g — the crest presses like its members and the expedition goes down into the file,dige:a487e6cf07243f0c
  step=6,desc:press the busiest region of the file — its methods become the vertebrae with their hits as ribs,dige:ce92b1e3858f8b93
  step=7,desc:press the busiest method — the chamber opens with its paragraphs as vertebrae and its source lines as ribs,dige:250e3da117b68376
  step=8,desc:press the head — the rope climbs back up to the region and its methods return,dige:08dbbf70f42d7fb9
  step=9,desc:walk a tunnel — in a chamber a line that calls another method is pressed and the expedition lands in that method,dige:e9cdb03cf74f5492
